WEBVTT

00:00:00.151 --> 00:00:01.338
One internship.

00:00:01.338 --> 00:00:02.563
Ten platforms.

00:00:02.563 --> 00:00:03.651
All pulling you in a different

00:00:03.651 --> 00:00:04.451
direction.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.631
Connected prep means every tool feeds

00:00:08.631 --> 00:00:09.906
one picture of you.

00:00:09.906 --> 00:00:11.619
That's the idea behind Placiq.

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:14.183
Your work, connected.
